---
import { site } from "../../config/site";
import Container from "../../components/ui/Container.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../../components/ui/SectionTitle.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="py-28 lg:py-36 bg-cotton">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="reveal">
        <SectionTitle
          label="Who We Are"
          title='An established Indian agribusiness, built on domestic trust and reaching toward global partnerships'
          titleClass="text-deep leading-tight"
        />
        <p class="mt-6 text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          {site.company.fullName} manufactures premium cotton bales and
          trades maize, pulses and food grains from sourcing regions across
          India. Our domestic network has been built over years of consistent
          delivery and straightforward dealing, and we are now extending that
          same discipline to international buyers, importers and distributors.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          We are actively expanding into global markets and structuring our
          operations, packaging and documentation to meet the expectations of
          international trade &mdash; without ever compromising on the
          sourcing and quality standards we were built on.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="stitch-border rounded-2xl p-5">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-deep">Our Vision</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/70">
              To become a globally trusted supplier of agricultural
              commodities.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="stitch-border rounded-2xl p-5">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-deep">Our Mission</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/70">
              Deliver quality products consistently while creating lasting
              partnerships.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="num-label uppercase mb-6">Our Journey</p>
        <ol class="relative border-l border-deep/15 pl-8 space-y-10">
          <li>
            <span class="absolute -left-[9px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold"
            ></span>
            <p class="font-display text-lg text-deep">
              Foundations in cotton
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 mt-1">
              Building a manufacturing discipline around premium cotton bales,
              grade consistency and dependable output.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="absolute -left-[9px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold"
            ></span>
            <p class="font-display text-lg text-deep">
              Widening into grains &amp; pulses
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 mt-1">
              Extending our sourcing network to maize, pulses and food grains
              to serve a broader base of domestic buyers.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="absolute -left-[9px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold"
            ></span>
            <p class="font-display text-lg text-deep">
              A trusted domestic network
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 mt-1">
              Long-standing relationships with mills, traders and processors
              built on consistency and integrity.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="absolute -left-[9px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-field"
            ></span>
            <p class="font-display text-lg text-deep">
              Preparing for global partnerships
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink/70 mt-1">
              Aligning packaging, documentation and quality processes with
              international trade standards, and actively engaging global
              buyers and distributors.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-deep">Integrity</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-deep">Quality</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-deep">Long-Term</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl text-deep">Satisfaction</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
